,NULL,0,'ENUMERATION',NULL),(176,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-11-13 09:43:22.496260','EASY','The primary goal of HCI is to design systems that are useful, humane, and desirable by effectively supporting user needs, capabilities, and experiences.',_binary '','The primary goal of HCI is to design systems that are useful, humane, and desirable by effectively supporting user needs, capabilities, and experiences.','What is the primary goal of Human-Computer Interaction (HCI)?',0,'PENDING','2026-11-13 09:43:22.496260',NULL,28,'[\"To design systems that are useful, humane, and desirable\",\"Design systems that are useful, humane, and desirable\"]',1,'ENUMERATION',NULL),(177,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-11-13 09:43:22.506227','EASY','HCI consists of three interconnected components: The Human (User) The Computer (System) The Interaction',_binary '','HCI consists of three interconnected components: the Human, the Computer, and the Interaction.','How many interconnected components consist in Human-Computer Interaction according to the overview?',0,'PENDING','2026-11-13 09:43:22.506227',NULL,28,'[\"Three\",\"3\"]',1,'ENUMERATION',NULL),(178,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-11-13 09:43:22.514200','MEDIUM','Includes: (IPOF Model)',_binary '','The Interaction Component includes the IPOF Model, which stands for Input, Process, Output, and Feedback.','Which model does the Interaction Component include?',0,'PENDING','2026-11-13 09:43:22.514200',NULL,28,'[\"IPOF Model\",\"IPOF\"]',1,'ENUMERATION',NULL),(179,'The study of how computers can replace human labor in automated factories.','The study of people and computer technology and the ways these influence each other.','The process of building hardware components for personal computers.','The evaluation of software bugs in enterprise networks.',1,'2026-11-13 09:45:01.910886','EASY','Human–Computer Interaction is “the study of people and computer technology and the ways these influence each other.” (Preece, Rogers, & Sharp, 2015)',_binary '